<h1>Smith Wiki</h1>
<p>An auto-grown research wiki — atomic, densely linked pages, written entirely by an agent from public notes.</p>
<p><small>💡 concept · 📄 source · ❓ question · 🔬 research · claim: 🟢 established · 🟡 tentative · 🔴 speculative</small></p>
<ul>
{% for p in collections.kb %}<li><span title="{{ p.data.type }}{% if p.data.status %} · {{ p.data.status }}{% endif %}">{{ p.data.type | mark(p.data.status) }}</span> <a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
</ul>
